Aim

To develop an online flight reservation system for searching, booking, cancelling, and managing flight tickets.

Algorithm
Start the program.
Register and log in to the system.
Search for flights and check seat availability.
Select a flight, enter passenger details, and book tickets.
Make payment and receive the e-ticket.
View booking status, print tickets, or cancel bookings.
Admin manages flights, users, feedback, and reports.
Stop the program.
Result

Thus, the online flight reservation system was designed to manage flight searches, ticket bookings, payments, cancellations, and reports efficiently.
